			"notes": "New features:\n- Notification for when GameQuery opens or closes the port\n- `get_block` query, which returns the block at a specified coordinate (in the same world as the player)\n- Generic `left_click` query\n- Generic `right_click` query\n- `select_slot` query, makes the player select a specific slot by slot number\n- `hotbar` query, returns a list of all items in the hotbar (the `inventory` query also includes the hotbar)\n- `open_container` opens any container that is currently on the player's crosshair\n- `attack` will attack (swing mainhand) at the entity on the player's crosshair\n- `shoot_bow` will switch to the slot with a bow, aim at the target (coordinate target or entity target), calculate the angle, and then fire the arrow, doing a full 1.3-second drawing animation"
		},
